    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forneah ða earman men beoð wyrs bereafode fram þam unrihtwisan deman þonne fram ðam wælgrimmestan here: ne bið nan heretoga swa gifre on fræmdrea manna yrfe swa se unrihtwisa dema byþ on his hyremanna.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The poor are robbed almost worse by the unjust judge than by the cruellest army. No military leader is as greedy for the property of others as the unjust judge is for [the property of] his subjects.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Grauius enim lacerantur pauperes a prauis iudicibus quam a cruentis hostibus; nullus hostis acerbior, nulla pestis efficatior quam familiaris inimicus.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
